' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-15T08:56:22.459Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"66b35cdd-ed1f-4b02-98bc-453244c7b960","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt_id":"66b35cdd-ed1f-4b02-98bc-453244c7b960","session_id":"74fcde9a-182f-454a-a75a-56740821e365","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"afd0d6bf-3993-4a5f-aa44-f6299602ad22","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"0f387dfa-609b-4003-8e95-1c9967669a74","thread":"afd0d6bf-3993-4a5f-aa44-f6299602ad22","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-0f387dfa-609b-4003-8e95-1c9967669a74"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-r4tk6hqu/c-76rilxj2/state/worktrees/fixture/T-081-self-report-unchanged-a1","base_commit":"f35dea801d7534a064108cbd4b0254c4ce71f0af","card_snapshot_id":"58e32474-e9bd-4e9f-96e0-7a260392ad78","reclaimed":false,"owner":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-15T08:56:23.612Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"66b35cdd-ed1f-4b02-98bc-453244c7b960","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-r4tk6hqu/c-76rilxj2/repo","cat-file","-t","dd1fc62042cf6aa75fca6d7c5961a7ea6a7a0423"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-r4tk6hqu/c-76rilxj2/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-15T08:56:23.618Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"66b35cdd-ed1f-4b02-98bc-453244c7b960","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-r4tk6hqu/c-76rilxj2/repo","cat-file","-t","dd1fc62042cf6aa75fca6d7c5961a7ea6a7a0423"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-r4tk6hqu/c-76rilxj2/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":30,"time":"2026-10-15T08:56:2